; A commodity quoted in two currencies: --latest reports its newest price
; and --monthly the newest price of each month, whichever currency each
; is quoted in.  The price graph yields a commodity's prices date-ordered
; only within each currency, so the last price it yields is not always
; the newest.  XYZ has no price at all and so no row in any of these
; reports.

P 2024/03/01 AAPL $150
P 2024/01/05 AAPL $120
P 2024/01/01 AAPL 100 EUR
P 2024/02/01 AAPL $140
P 2023/12/01 AAPL 90 EUR

2023/11/15 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage     1 AAPL
    Assets:Cash

2023/11/16 Unpriced
    Assets:Other         5 XYZ
    Equity:Opening

test prices --now 2024/06/30
